; Swing duration controlled by cooldown — LMB melee uses
; cooldown / atk_spd as the stretched anim duration. basic_attack
; is BLADE-ONLY now (sledgehammer uses melee_2h_attack.tres), so we
; can dial this hard for the snappy skirmisher feel without touching
; the heavy-2H pacing. 0.6 + atk_spd 1.0-1.4 lands the swing window
; at 0.43-0.60s — proper dart cadence. Lunge follows at half that
; (~0.22-0.30s).
cooldown = 0.6
wind_up = 0.22
resource_cost = 10
